Package: solitty
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ncurses-based klondike solitaire game
 A terminal Klondike solitaire game with UTF-8 card symbols,
 keyboard (arrow keys / hjkl) and mouse (click to pick up and
 place, right-click to cancel) support.
